1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,760
A fool, but an honest fool he remains.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,160
We've been strangely fortunate.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,200
Pippin saw in the palantír a
glimpse of the Enemy's plan.

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:17,000
Sauron moves to strike
the city of Minas Tirith.

5
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,920
- I will go.
- No.

6
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,920
- They must be warned.
- They will be.

7
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:28,600
You must come to Minas
Tirith by another road.

8
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:32,480
Follow the river. Look to the black ships.

9
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,680
Understand this.

10
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:39,560
Things are now in motion
that cannot be undone.

11
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,000
I ride for Minas Tirith.

12
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,880
And I won't be going alone.

13
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,640
How far is Minas Tirith?

14
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,480
Three days' ride, as the Nazgûl flies.

15
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,720
And you'd better hope we don't
have one of those on our tail.

16
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:02,560
Here. Something for the road.

17
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:05,920
The last of the Longbottom Leaf.

18
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:07,680
I know you've run out.

19
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,960
You smoke too much, Pip.

20
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:12,520
But we'll see each other soon.

21
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:18,560
- Won't we?
- I don't know.

22
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:22,320
I don't know what's going to happen.

23
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,800
- Merry?
- Run, Shadowfax.

24
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:27,600
- Show us the meaning of haste.
- Merry!

25
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:48,040
We've just passed into the realm of Gondor.

26
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:04,440
Minas Tirith. City of Kings.
